DEPENDENCIES
    express    HTTP server
    cors       Cross-origin access
    dotenv     Environment config
    ethers     Blockchain interaction (v6)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
API ENDPOINTS
  PAID APIs (x402 protected — requires X-Payment header)
    GET  /api/v1/catalog          List all available APIs with on-chain prices
    GET  /api/v1/btc              BTC/USD price  ($0.001 USDC)
    GET  /api/v1/eth              ETH/USD price  ($0.001 USDC)
    GET  /api/v1/sol              SOL/USD price  ($0.0005 USDC)
    GET  /api/v1/gas              Ethereum gas tracker  ($0.0005 USDC)
    GET  /api/v1/call/:apiId      Proxy any on-chain registered API (dynamic price)
  PAYMENT
    GET  /payment/nonce           Generate fresh nonce + deadline (5 min expiry)
    POST /payment/verify          Pre-flight signature check (no nonce consumed)
    GET  /payment/balance/:addr   USDC balance for any wallet
    GET  /payment/status          Payment layer health check
  REGISTRY (on-chain APIRegistry.sol)
    GET  /registry/apis           List all registered APIs (marketplace)
    GET  /registry/api/:id        Single API detail + recent activity
    GET  /registry/provider/:addr All APIs owned by a provider
    GET  /registry/stats          Total API count + chain status
    POST /registry/register       Register a new API on-chain
    PUT  /registry/api/:id        Update price or active status
  DASHBOARD (wallet spend view)
    GET  /dashboard/:address              Overview: balance, spend, call count
    GET  /dashboard/:address/history      Paginated call history
    GET  /dashboard/:address/spend        Spend breakdown per API
  PROVIDER PORTAL (earnings view)
    GET  /provider/:address               Overview: earnings, APIs, call stats
    GET  /provider/:address/earnings      Earnings breakdown per API
    GET  /provider/:address/calls         Paginated incoming call history
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
X402 PAYMENT FLOW
    Agent                    Gateway                  Morph Hoodi
      |                         |                          |
      |-- GET /api/v1/btc ----->|                          |
      |<-- 402 Payment Required-|                          |
      |    (amount, provider,   |                          |
      |     facilitator,        |                          |
      |     chainId, nonce URL) |                          |
      |                         |                          |
      |-- GET /payment/nonce -->|                          |
      |<-- { nonce, deadline } -|                          |
      |                         |                          |
      | [agent signs off-chain] |                          |
      |                         |                          |
      |-- GET /api/v1/btc ----->|                          |
      |   X-Payment: base64(    |                          |
      |     payer, provider,    |                          |
      |     amount, nonce,      |-- verifyPayment()        |
      |     deadline, sig)      |   (off-chain ECDSA)      |
      |                         |                          |
      |<-- 200 OK + data -------|                          |
      |                         |-- facilitator.settle() ->|
      |                         |   (payer, provider, sig) |
      |                         |                          |-- verify sig == payer
      |                         |                          |-- transferFrom(payer->provider)
      |                         |                          |-- emit PaymentSettled
      |                         |<-- txHash ---------------|
      |                         |   ledger.record()        |
    Key properties:
    - Agent signs once, gateway settles on-chain
    - Nonce consumed in-memory before response, permanently on-chain after settle
    - Settlement is async — agent does not wait for on-chain confirmation
    - Every settled payment is recorded in the ledger for dashboard queries
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCRIPTS
    node scripts/pay.mjs      Single end-to-end payment test (BTC endpoint)
    node scripts/agent.mjs    Full demo agent
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SMART CONTRACTS
    APIRegistry.sol
        - Permissionless API registration
        - On-chain pricing (pricePerCall in USDC, 6 decimals)
        - Provider ownership and update rights
        - Enumerable listings for agent discovery
    X402Facilitator.sol
        - Gateway-mediated settlement
        - ECDSA signature verification against declared payer
        - Nonce-based replay protection
        - 99% to provider / 1% to treasury fee split
        - Deadline enforcement